good things happen for you.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.880
<i>...might be the protective charm at work.</i>

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:54.570
Nyamero-sama, you have my thanks!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:06:00.080
<i>She really saved my skin back in Okinawa.</i>

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:05.120
<i>Helpin' me out during the employee 
retreat when I was meltin'...</i>

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.210
<i>She's always bein' so thoughtful with me...</i>

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.280
<i>I owe her way too much!</i>

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:19.790
<i>There's gotta be </i>some<i> way to 
pay her back for all she's done!</i>

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:33.850
<b>Say "Thank you!"</b>

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:34.740
<b>Treat them to a restaurant meal!</b>

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:36.800
<i>That'll do it!</i>

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:43.250
Delicious!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.390
You really like fried tofu, don't you?

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:49.630
It's 'cause I'm the descendant 
of a fox spirit and all.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:53.260
What's your favorite food, Fuyutsuki-san?

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.560
My favorite food?

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.830
I like everything.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:04.640
Even as a child, I was never picky.

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.560
That's awesome!

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:08.070
<i>She's not picky?</i>

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:10.790
Let me buy you my favorite fried 
tofu omelet rice sometime, then!

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.150
<i>Magnificent!</i>

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:15.510
<i>But where should I take her, then?</i>

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:14.310
The broth is so rich...

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:20.650
<i>Okay. I better just ask her!</i>

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:29.970
Fuyutsuki-san.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:31.560
Yes?

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:35.640
Out of French, Italian, 
Japanese, Chinese, Korean,

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:40.730
Vietnamese, Thai, Mexican, 
Indian, Nepalese, and Spanish...

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.430
Which one's your favorite cuisine?

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:50.950
I like... all of them.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.960
<i>All of them?!</i>

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:05.160
If she likes everything, maybe 
I oughta choose based on decor...

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:08.880
Nah, pickin' a place close to 
work makes more sense...

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.450
Oh, crud! Now I've done it...

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.670
You okay?

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:17.980
Oh... yes. Thank you.

