<i>Today, I'll ask her.</i>

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:48.530
Today, I'll ask her!

00:08:49.060 --> 00:08:50.210
Today...

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:59.600
Himuro-kun?

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.020
Why are you completely covered in ice?

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:05.040
Fuyutsuki-san!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:12.280
The truth is, I generate cold from
 my fingertips when I'm nervous.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.750
That seems to be a constant lately.

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:16.790
Are you all right?

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:17.820
Yes.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:21.290
There's something important 
I have to do today.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:25.660
Would you like a massage to help you relax?

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:33.670
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.070
It's agony!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.300
You're stronger than I expected!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.800
I'm very familiar with the 
pressure points of the foot.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.600
You're very stiff, sir.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:45.600
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.600
Not there!

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:50.070
Well? Do you feel more relaxed now?

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:50.070
It hurts!

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:55.500
You will succeed at what you try.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.570
Please, have confidence.

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:00.370
Fuyutsuki-san...

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:05.580
Would you...

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.500
Yes?

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:16.840
Would you join me for dinner tonight?

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.910
W-Well, I found a restaurant
 that sounded good.

00:10:23.910 --> 00:10:27.000
Plus, you always do so much for me...

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.740
I was hoping to repay you.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:35.150
Would you be willing... to try it with me?

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.080
I... I...

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.440
If you'd like.

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:43.470
Then I'll talk to you at the end of the day.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:47.010
Of course. Thank you.

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:56.000
Did he just ask me out on a date?

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:00.720
I-I'm sorry to bother you.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:04.130
I'd like to make a reservation.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:07.400
<i>Yes, sir. How many, and for what time?</i>

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.310
Seven o'clock.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:12.020
It'll be the two of us.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:14.140
<i>"The two of us"?!</i>

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:17.010
<i>Hang on! This is soundin' like a date!</i>

00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:18.390
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:27.840
I always know where Himuro-san is.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.440
This is it.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.340
It's delicious.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.320
It is.

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:30.240
<i>Fuyutsuki-san likes it!</i>

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.800
<i>I sure am glad!</i>

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.080
Snow?

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:42.000
Is it some kind of show?

00:12:54.360 --> 00:12:58.500
<i>It feels harder than usual 
to converse with him.</i>

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:05.790
<i>I never know what Himuro-kun is thinking.</i>

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:11.840
<i>Of course, I know that 
I'm equally hard to read...</i>

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:18.790
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's awful pretty...</i>

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.670
<i>Himuro-kun must be bored.</i>

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.630
<i>I can't really make witty conversation.</i>

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:41.040
<i>Is it actually fun to spend 
time with me, I wonder?</i>

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:48.050
<i>Oh, heck... I was starin' at her.</i>

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:56.280
<i>Fuyutsuki-san hasn't spoken 
for a while, either...</i>

00:13:56.680 --> 00:13:59.570
<i>I oughta try to make conversation.</i>

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:02.620
<i>I need to try to make conversation.</i>

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:08.640
<i>But...</i>

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:11.680
<i>But...</i>

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:16.320
<i>I have no idea what to say.</i>

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:16.320
<i>I got no idea what to say.</i>

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.580
<b>Work</b>

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:26.390
I'm sorry. It's work.

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:27.450
Go ahead.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:30.940
Hello?

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.350
Yes, Fuyutsuki speaking.

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:37.420
Yes.

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:42.100
All right. Goodbye.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.700
Are you on a date?

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.420
I'm so jealous.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:50.610
Yes... Thank you for asking.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:54.610
It's been a truly wonderful day!

00:14:55.750 --> 00:14:56.610
Excuse me.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.070
Um...

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.450
F-Fuyutsuki-san...

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:07.620
D-Did you... hear that?

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.630
Yes.

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.980
H-Himuro-kun?

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.060
Sir?!

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:23.400
<i>I learned something new 
about Himuro-kun today.</i>

00:15:24.250 --> 00:15:27.350
<i>He melts when he's embarrassed, too.</i>

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.750
<i>Yesterday sure was fun...</i>

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:38.530
Himuro-san, any plans for lunch?

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:43.080
<i>I got closer to Fuyutsuki-san! What a score!</i>

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.110
Himuro-san?

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:51.020
<i>I wanna get dinner with her again!</i>

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.120
Are you listening?

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:55.970
Hey, it's Fuyutsuki-san.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.440
What? Where?

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.970
Where? Where?

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:00.930
Ow! That hurts!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.960
<i>I bet Himuro-san had a good day yesterday.</i>

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:10.930
Say...

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.480
Fuyutsuki-san.

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:16.290
How do you feel about Himuro-san?

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.000
Well...

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:22.940
<i>Wait.</i>

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.500
<i>Hang on, hang on!</i>

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.550
<i>J-Just a minute here.</i>

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:33.510
<i>I get the feeling I stumbled onto somethin'...</i>

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:37.010
How do I... feel?

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:41.320
You know! You guys are 
together, like, all the time!

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.520
Are you two gettin' close, or...

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.700
<i>Close?!</i>

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.770
Close?

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:50.520
Well... I'm not sure.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.130
Let me see...

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.080
Himuro-san?

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:59.780
I'd say... we're not close at all.

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:04.040
You okay?

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:08.050
I don't even know his phone number.

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:12.010
I don't know what he does on his days off.

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:15.610
We have a hard time holding a conversation.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.610
But even so...

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:24.440
I like him a great deal.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:30.870
First, I'd like to make a snowman with him.

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:32.940
Then we could go sledding.

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.950
<i>I feel the same!</i>

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:42.950
Wait, you guys haven't 
exchanged numbers yet?

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:45.770
<i>My colleague, Himuro-kun,</i>

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:48.960
<i>suddenly asked to exchange 
contact information with me.</i>

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.220
<i>I wonder what got into him.</i>

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.760
Um... Fuyutsuki-san?

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:58.960
Yes?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:03.470
<b></b>Nyamero

