<b></b>Nyamero

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.860
<b></b>Let's keep in touch.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:19.950
I feel like I'm talking to 
Nyamero instead of you.

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.530
I'm sorry.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.990
If it's confusing, I can change the name.

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:28.470
No, Nyamero is very cute.

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:33.500
Would you like me to send new
 pictures of Nyamero after I get home?

00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:35.970
