<b></b>Nyamero
You have a new message

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:17.170
<b></b>Good evening to mew

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:21.810
<i>"Mew"?!</i>

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.980
<i>Gotta save that one forever!</i>

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.470
Eh? Hang on...

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:29.840
No way.

