00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.120
Aw, heck!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:49.450
<b></b>Nyamero

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:49.450
<b>Today</b>

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:49.450
<b>Today</b>

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:49.450
<b></b>Good morning. Let's have
 another productive day.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:49.450
<b></b>Good morning. Let's have
 another productive day.

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:53.460
Yes! I'll do my best!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.770
Himuro-kun, have you had lunch?

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.630
Eh? What time is it?

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:09.770
Around 12:30.

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:13.640
It might be best to take your break now.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.640
Yes, you're right.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:22.690
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's lock screen is the pic 
from the employee retreat.</i>

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:24.780
Oh, it...

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:27.480
It was just such a nice picture.

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:28.960
I'm sorry.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.910
I should have asked before using it.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.290
Not at all.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.910
Those fireworks were certainly beautiful.

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:39.700
<i>Fuyutsuki-san put me on her phone!</i>

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.430
<i>Bliss!</i>

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.400
<i>That was close.</i>

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.930
<i>My lock screen is the group picture,</i>

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:59.070
<i>but my home screen is...</i>

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:03.280
<i>He was so cute, I couldn't help myself.</i>

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.440
Whoops.

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:09.630
I left my wallet.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.650
I-It's nothing.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:22.200
<i>I can't let him know that my home 
screen is from when he was little.</i>

00:22:57.970 --> 00:23:02.970
Sorry to ask you to come with me to buy lunch.

00:23:02.970 --> 00:23:04.230
Not at all.

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:07.980
I normally have to wait in 
line for this otherwise.

00:23:08.390 --> 00:23:09.730
I feel very lucky.

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:14.490
<i>A smile like that's gotta be illegal!</i>

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:19.000
<i>I'm the lucky one here!</i>

00:23:23.000 --> 00:23:26.160
Hey, Himuro!

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.510
That you, Himuro?!

00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:29.690
Katori?

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:32.350
What are you doing here?

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:38.490
It's been forever!
